Rules:
- Return the exact same scene numbers and count.
- Do not add narration, facts, subtitles, advice, explanations, statistics, labels, or readable text.
- image_prompt and motion_prompt must be English ASCII only.
- Prefer cinematic 3D render, one clear focal subject, stable geometry, fixed camera.
- Avoid complex hand interaction, extra limbs, crowd motion, rapid camera motion, readable text, UI, logos.
- Motion should be simple, physically plausible, and visually related to the scene meaning.
- Do not output technical generation parameters such as fps, frames, steps, cfg, sampler, resolution, checkpoint or seed.
Return JSON only with this schema:
{
  "visual_plan_version":"1.0",
  "scenes":[{"scene":1,"image_prompt":"","motion_prompt":""}],
  "status":"PASS"
}`.trim();

const userPrompt = `Create visual prompts for exactly ${sceneCount} scenes.\n\nTopic: ${config.input?.concept || ''}\nVisual style: ${config.creative?.visual_style || 'cinematic 3D render'}\n\nValidated scenes:\n${JSON.stringify(scenes, null, 2)}\n\nReturn JSON only.`;

return [{ json: {
  stage:'scene_adapter_ready',
  scene_adapter_version:'1.0',
  title: input.title || config.input?.concept || '',
  script_summary: input.narration.slice(0,160),
